### Team lead routing
When choosing which expert(s) to recommend, check each candidate's own
`MEMORY.md` index and `short_memory.md` for recent work on the topic. Prefer
experts who have durable knowledge pinned in the relevant area. Record your
routing decisions (who you picked and why) in *your own* `short_memory.md` so
future routings benefit from the pattern.
